{"metadata":{"title":[{"Plain":"“环面码”"},2],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"环面码"},0]},"content":{"Plain":"\n<blockquote>\n<p>The <strong>toric code</strong> is a canonical example of a system with topological order and <strong>anyonic excitations</strong>.</p>\n</blockquote>\n"}}